            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "There is no reliable public data comparing lifespans. Owners have reported core crush and delamination on some paddles of all types. Choose a well-reviewed model with a strong warranty, store it away from heat, and watch for dead spots or changes in sound."
          }
        },
