          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is a Gen 3 or Gen 4 paddle?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "These are informal marketing labels. Gen 3 usually refers to the thermoformed, foam-edged raw carbon paddles that became popular around 2023. Gen 4 often refers to later designs with fuller foam cores or other changes. Compare actual construction details rather than relying on generation names."
